## SchemeWeaver MCP plugin: commit only the bundled, self-contained entry so the
## Claude Code plugin runs without a build/node_modules (the Mcp project's own
## .gitignore keeps the rest of dist/ out). A parent-dir exclusion can't be undone
## by a deeper .gitignore, so the directory is re-included here.
!src/Umbraco.Community.SchemeWeaver.Mcp/dist/
!src/Umbraco.Community.SchemeWeaver.Mcp/dist/index.js

## SchemeWeaver.AI satellite: Vite build output (regenerated at pack time).
## Keep the hand-written umbraco-package.json; ignore the compiled JS.
src/Umbraco.Community.SchemeWeaver.AI/wwwroot/*.js

